{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dice to Meet You",
    "steam_appid": 2597140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6a68bd91edf8f482c24c36b530856690.poster.avif?t=1696709989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6a68bd91edf8f482c24c36b530856690.webm?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6a68bd91edf8f482c24c36b530856690.mp4?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's your first day at work and you're determined to prove you've got what it takes. Collaborate with your coworkers to submit all your reports and you might just make employee of the month! Just be sure those numbers line up...<br><br><i>Dice to Meet You</i> is a cute, casual puzzle game that will challenge your spatial reasoning with every turn of the dice. With dozens of unique levels to play through there's never been a better time to gather around the fern and show your coworkers your sensitive side.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6ddbe716d00c34ba4c10c5a57ea141c6.poster.avif?t=1696709989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6ddbe716d00c34ba4c10c5a57ea141c6.webm?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6ddbe716d00c34ba4c10c5a57ea141c6.mp4?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Win by getting to the end of the level with the correct side (as shown by the level exit) facing up.<br></li><li>Coworkers will mirror your movements as long as you have the same side facing up as they do.<br></li><li>Some buttons require you to have the correct face pointing up. They will show a number of dots on their face.<br></li><li>Red buttons need to be held down continuously to function, but blue buttons do not.<br></li><li>All levels are unlocked in the &quot;Cubicle Select&quot; if you get stuck!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/1d48a1f9a0ad2581ab455db775cfd00f.poster.avif?t=1696709989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/1d48a1f9a0ad2581ab455db775cfd00f.webm?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/1d48a1f9a0ad2581ab455db775cfd00f.mp4?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;WASD&quot; to move the die.<br></li><li>Reset the level with &quot;R&quot; or the button in the bottom right corner.<br></li><li>Return to the main menu with &quot;ESC&quot; or the button in the bottom right corner.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6a68bd91edf8f482c24c36b530856690.poster.avif?t=1696709989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6a68bd91edf8f482c24c36b530856690.webm?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6a68bd91edf8f482c24c36b530856690.mp4?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's your first day at work and you're determined to prove you've got what it takes. Collaborate with your coworkers to submit all your reports and you might just make employee of the month! Just be sure those numbers line up...<br><br><i>Dice to Meet You</i> is a cute, casual puzzle game that will challenge your spatial reasoning with every turn of the dice. With dozens of unique levels to play through there's never been a better time to gather around the fern and show your coworkers your sensitive side.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6ddbe716d00c34ba4c10c5a57ea141c6.poster.avif?t=1696709989\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6ddbe716d00c34ba4c10c5a57ea141c6.webm?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597140/extras/6ddbe716d00c34ba4c10c5a57ea141c6.mp4?t=1696709989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Win by getting to the end of the level with the correct side (as shown by the level exit) facing up.<br></li><li>Coworkers will mirror your movements as 